{"ID":"20250815154003-pyrzco5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250815154003-pyrzco5","title":"UPL2-5——Memory 模块","type":"doc","updated":"20250829133822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815154003-pi4ve18","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250815154003-pi4ve18","updated":"20250829133822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory 模块"}]},{"ID":"20250815154029-9uk537t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815154029-9uk537t","updated":"20250815154036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory（内存）模块是 Unity 中用于监视 内存使用情况 的关键工具\n它能帮助你识别哪些资源在占用大量内存，是否存在内存泄漏或垃圾回收频繁等问题"}]},{"ID":"20250815154029-2f0s6g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815154029-2f0s6g9","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏开发中会造成内存开销的主要有："}]},{"ID":"20250815154044-h0e1rqb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-h0e1rqb","updated":"20250828194302"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815154044-ditdk3z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-ditdk3z","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815154044-s15n1hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-s15n1hp","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纹理贴图"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815154044-8rz9kqg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-8rz9kqg","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815154044-ciha5kn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-ciha5kn","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网格"}]}]},{"ID":"20250815154044-0wif4xn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250815154044-0wif4xn","updated":"20250815154044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250815154044-ppxpagz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250815154044